Package: sapi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: SaltStack salt-api hybrid CLI client and Full-Access MCP Server
 sapi is a fast, standalone command-line client wrapping SaltStack's salt-api
 (netapi: rest_cherrypy / rest_tornado).
 .
 Features:
  - Drop-in Salt-native shortcut syntax (e.g., "sapi '*' test.ping")
  - Structured subcommands (run, async, batch, job, minion, runner, wheel,
    key, event, profile, auth, stats, mcp)
  - Multi-profile TOML configuration (~/.config/sapi/config.toml) and
    automatic X-Auth-Token caching (~/.cache/sapi/tokens.json)
  - Pretty (with highstate summary), JSON, YAML, and Table output renderers
  - Built-in Full-Access Model Context Protocol (MCP) server over stdio
    ("sapi mcp") exposing 12 Salt tools for AI coding and ops agents
